# The members are ordinals with no E4–E7 bookings or registrations, keeping their generated fictional names:
# 163 ABONAT/SEPA asks for next month (the pending request), 156 ABONAT/SEPA is inactive this month and the next (fee
# snapshot frozen), 152 ABONAT/cash leaves on the next 31-08, 172 PACK10/SEPA has a 10-session pack expired yesterday and
# its planned leave. Cash members (every third ordinal) give the half-year branch.
billing:
